Subject: [PATCH] Dec 31 is Crowther, Aug 14 is Daniels; Virgil and Dorothy Day
 open as Greater Church; cover image script

Calendar overrides record the two curator decisions. Virgil of Salzburg is in no TEC source
and Dorothy Day is only in the HWHM appendix, so both entries now open
'Today the Greater Church commemorates'. npm run cover makes cover-400.png and og.png from
the green cover once it is in public/assets/.
